EERRRROORRSS
     The following may result in rejection of an operation:

     [EINVAL]        The given node number is not zero and does not correspond
                     to any valid node, or is zero where zero is not allowed.

     [EBADF]         The requested operation requires permissions not speci‐
                     fied at the call to ooppeenn().

     [ENAMETOOLONG]  The given name or value field exceeds the maximum allowed
                     length (8191 bytes).

     [ENOMEM]        Memory could not be allocated.

     [ENOTTY]        The ioctl is not supported on this architecture.

