HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The ooppeennpprroomm interface first appeared in OpenBSD 3.0 for sparc64.  It has
     been available on macppc since OpenBSD 4.3, on octeon since OpenBSD 6.0,
     on armv7 since OpenBSD 6.0, and on arm64 since OpenBSD 6.1.

BBUUGGSS
     Due to limitations within the OPENPROM itself, these functions run at el‐
     evated priority and may adversely affect system performance.

